    Yeint’s Experimental Research Platform

This iteration of the Yerp project aims to
implement the entire pipeline of operating
system development in the DC programming 
language.

Repositary contains the source code of the
EFI bootloader called loader, the operating
system kernel, called supervisor as well as
all of the relevant drivers and build system
code for scaffolding and building the project.

